            id="7af5971f-1a6c-47d3-b9a8-4e709444113e" name="Cislunar Cargo Tug" description="&lt;p>The system of interest (was OE-3 Cislunar Cargo Transport). The ground segment is outside the boundary (D-11).&lt;/p>&lt;p>Design point (D-16, D-17, D-20): see the property values.&lt;/p>&lt;p>Whole-system requirements: SR-05, SR-06, SR-13, SR-24.&lt;/p>&lt;p>Source: System Analysis, section 1; trade-offs, section 6.&lt;/p>"
            appliedPropertyValueGroups="#2c7575dd-87b4-4efe-ae96-7ce3e1bab379">
